kpi Recommended default | Premier | $492 a year per employee | neutral

We recommend **Premier** as the default plan for our 112 employees. In the pulse survey, 38 employees said they have children who will need braces soon, so orthodontia coverage matters.

# Plans
table = Plan,Monthly premium,Annual maximum,Deductible,Orthodontia; Basic,$14,"$1,000",$75,None; Plus,$28,"$1,500",$50,None; **Premier**,**$41**,"**$2,500**",**$25**,"50%, lifetime max $1,500"; Family Max,$63,"$3,000",None,"50%, lifetime max $2,000"

